 "remarks": "Sunny 1 BR unit in quiet brick condo building in downtown Stamford. This unit has a large bedroom and living room with minimal hall area, ample closets, hardwood floors, an updated bathroom and a gas stove. Just one block to parks, restaurants and shopping. Heat, hot water, gas and reserved parking included in rent. Laundry on site on ground level. Second parking space is also available for rent. No extra charges for trash, water or amenities. Smaller building allows for easy access to your car in 5 minutes. Concrete, brick and steel construction buffers the sound between units for a quiet peaceful lifestyle. Excellent credit and references required. Terrific management and landlord. Schedule a tour today!",
